n><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'enum'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  enum: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'positive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'negative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'neutral'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'分析以下评论的情感倾向：这款产品质量很好，物流也很快'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(object);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>结构化输出将 LLM 的自由文本转化为程序可直接消费的类型安全数据。AI SDK 6 的 <code>generateObject</code> 配合 Zod Schema，提供了从定义到验证的完整方案：Zod 的 <code>.describe()</code> 帮助模型理解字段语义，Structured Output Mode 保证输出严格符合 Schema，TypeScript 类型推断让开发体验无缝衔接。在实际项目中，结构化输出广泛应用于信息提取、内容分类、数据转换等场景，是构建可靠 AI 应用的基础能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结构化输出","id":"结构化输出"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要结构化输出","id":"为什么需要结构化输出"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON Mode vs Structured Output Mode","id":"json-mode-vs-structured-output-mode"},{"level":2,"text":"Zod Schema 定义","id":"zod-schema-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"常用 Zod 类型映射","id":"常用-zod-类型映射"},{"level":2,"text":"generateObject 基本用法","id":"generateobject-基本用法"},{"level":2,"text":"在 Hono API 中使用","id":"在-hono-api-中使用"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 验证与错误处理","id":"schema-验证与错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"enum 输出模式","id":"enum-输出模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"函数调用规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/function-calling/function-calling-spec"},"next":{"title":"Tool 定义与执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/function-calling/tool-definition"}}